<title>ZIMBABWE: GOLF-ZIMBABWE OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ZIMBABWE OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in the Zimbabwe Open at the par-72 Chapman Golf Club on Thursday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>65 Steve van Vuuren, Des Terblanche</p>
<p>67 Schalk van der Merwe (Namibia)</p>
<p>68 Nick Price (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>69 Mark Cayeux (Zimbabwe), Andrew Pitts (U.S.), Dion</p>
<p>Fourie</p>
<p>70 Nasho Kamungeremu (Zimbabwe), James Kingston, Ian</p>
<p>Hutchings, Clinton Whitelaw</p>
<p>71 Deane Pappas, Mark Murless, Bobby Verwey senior,</p>
<p>Justin Hobday, Ryan Dreyer, John Blatch (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>72 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe), Simon Hobday, Trevor Dodds</p>
<p>(Namibia), Greg Reid, Desvonde Botes, Adilson da</p>
<p>Silva (Brazil), Michael Scholz, Ashley Roestoff,</p>
<p>Bradford Vaughan, Bobby Verwey junior, Andrew Park,</p>
<p>Colin Lotter, Steven Waltman</p>
<p>73 Ian Palmer, Hugh Baiocchi, Tony Johnstone (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>74 Gavin Levenson</p>
